---
name: css-best-practices.mdc

description: Best practices for CSS styling

globs: **/*.css

---

- Use BEM (Block Element Modifier) methodology for class naming.

- Minimize CSS specificity to avoid conflicts.

- Utilize CSS variables for consistent theming.

- Implement responsive design with media queries.

- Centralize common styles (e.g., colors, fonts) in a single file for easy updates.
